      "kind": "paragraph",
      "key": "b2",
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "E171 Titanium dioxide: a bright white mineral pigment used to whiten and opacify foods; the EU banned it as a food additive in 2022 over safety concerns."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "key": "b3",
