      "kind": "uncertainty",
      "key": "b21",
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A count of sources says how much has been written, not how risky a thing is. A well studied additive can be well studied because it is common, and a quiet one can be quiet because nobody has looked. What matters for you is the amount in the food in front of you, which this page cannot tell you."
